  "body": "Three inherited automation jobs submit prompts/playbooks that explicitly target PrefectHQ/prefect. Running them in Ariadne produced HTTP404 requests with an unconfigured upstream organization.\n\nAdd a repository applicability condition to those jobs. Existing step bodies and failure/main conditions are preserved; Unit and release workflow bytes are unchanged. The active full Unit run42000763887 continues against unchanged product and test sources.\n\nValidation: actionlint1.7.12 passed all three workflows; parsed configurations match after removing the new applicability predicate; the architect independently reviewed the exact diff. Fork skip behavior will be checked after merge.\n\n[Original failures and scope proof](https://github.com/Anacreonsystems/ariadne/blob/native-stream-storage/architecture/streaming-etl/evidence/native-epoch2-upstream-automation-scope-2026-11-05/index.json).\n",
  "changed_files": 7,
